  "accuracy": "A case passes at 20 percent only if both predictions lie within the inclusive band.",
  "deadlines": "Floor 80 percent and ceil 120 percent of the native median to whole milliseconds. Strictly greater than the limit is a timeout. Compare against all seven native votes, report unanimous false passes, unanimous false timeouts and mixed native decisions.",
  "stability": "Retain every repetition, component deltas, native minimum, median, maximum, and native (maximum minus minimum) divided by median. Describe the subset with a native median of at least 20 ms and spread at most 10 percent. Retain all cases for primary scoring.",
